{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "這個怎麼好露出一角也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如此從前不會悟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "那裏去來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滿口野狐涎先打東\n林覺三十青柴何故賺人不少次打張商英三十苕帚柄何故不合受他家冬𤓰印子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "笑裏有刀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元來元來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "盡底去也未"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "猶帶尿真氣在"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "始知兜率不汝欺也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "語風代云定盤星爆也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "何不早恁麼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "士減切音劖山高峻貌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "徒官切音團以手圜之也又取飯作摶掜聚也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昵格切音蹃捉搦也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "輸芮切音稅蛻其屍衣冠不解如蛇蛻耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "都木\n切音篤與𡰪同尾下竅也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "質力切音職肉敗也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "側六切音纖塞也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "直䧟切音詀賣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "許穢切音以喙而息也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "杜結切音耋日𣅦也言日蹉跌而下謂未時也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奔模切音逋申時也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七倫切音逡皮細起也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "着"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "着"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "着"}
